# Seed Data and Reset Guide — {{project_slug}}

The app must not look empty in sandbox review. Every implemented feature must have representative demo data.

## Required Seeder Policy

- Each user-facing feature slice must add or update Laravel seeders.
- Seed at least 10 realistic records for each feature unless the feature naturally has fewer valid states.
- Seed all roles/personas needed to test the planned flows.
- Seed edge cases where useful: draft, active, approved, rejected, overdue, archived, failed, or escalated records.
- Keep demo credentials and reset commands documented here after every slice.

